(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Lord's gauge theory of gravitation and the brochon: the notebook of the checks\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"34a75810-1d2c-4123-822a-21e9b47742eb"],

Cell["\<\
PROJECT spacetimes, folder Revision_Lord_Gravity. The notebook \
lord_gravity.nb, prepared for Patrick Lee Nash, Ph.D.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"511e8ef6-cf03-4760-bddd-4669ea7fa050"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["What this notebook is.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The folder ",
 StyleBox["Revision_Lord_Gravity",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " holds a manuscript, ",
 StyleBox["lord_gravity.md",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", that reads E. A. Lord's paper \"General relativity from gauge \
invariance\" (Proceedings of the Cambridge Philosophical Society 69, 423 \
(1971)), relates his gauge group to the group ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SL", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"2", ",", 
      StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalC]",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "aa734f27-4960-49cf-9c95-2caf7ceff473"],
 " of the project, couples the spinor field of the project, the brochon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "27e8b025-0844-40b4-a6e9-acc5dfcb1d7f"],
 ", to gravitation, and solves its equations around black holes. Its \
statements are checked by programs in three languages: Rust, Python and the \
Wolfram Language. The nine scripts in the Wolfram Language make 46 checks, \
most of them in exact arithmetic. This notebook runs all of them, in the \
order of the manuscript, and explains before each check what it decides and \
why it matters. A student who works through it sees every algebraic identity \
of the manuscript being verified, and can change the inputs and watch what \
happens."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"93a73436-8ec4-44a4-934c-2f9b2690800e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["How to use it.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Open the notebook in Wolfram (version 15 or later; it was evaluated with \
Wolfram 15.0.1) and choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. The cells are \
evaluated in order; the whole notebook takes about a minute. Nothing outside \
the notebook is read: the three data files that some checks compare with are \
written into closed cells (a closed cell shows only a thin bracket; \
double-click the bracket to open it). Every check prints one line that begins \
with PASS or FAIL, and the last chapter lists all checks."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"601ae770-aceb-4bbc-9609-a0ffa9936107"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["How to read it.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A text cell explains, in words and formulas, what the next input cell \
computes. The formulas in the texts use the symbols of the manuscript; the \
code uses short names of its own, which the comments in the code and the \
texts name (for example ",
 StyleBox["sig",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for the four matrices ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "274cebb2-926e-404b-8846-1ed982c612c2"],
 "). A symbol with the suffix LL is an object of the Lorentz super-loop and \
of its fields, SF an object of the brochon model and of its superfluid ground \
state, LG an object that this folder introduces (the gravitational field, the \
black holes and their problems), and Lord an object of Lord's paper in his \
own notation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1d6df202-c5e2-4ca5-b318-858e36ee38b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The checks and their counterparts.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Each check has an identifier: WL for Lord's paper, WG for the curved \
space-time, WS for the Schwarzschild field, WV for the Vaidya field, WP, WC, \
WT and WA for the four computations of the pair and the black holes, WW for \
the worked examples. The line that a check prints names, in parentheses, the \
checks of the Rust program and of the Python program of the folder that test \
the same statement in floating point, so that a reader without a Wolfram \
license can follow every step with those programs (folders ",
 StyleBox["rust/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the folder). The notebook runs the code of the scripts in ",
 StyleBox["wolfram/source/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " unchanged; each chapter runs in a context of its own (for example ",
 StyleBox["LGNB`Lord` ",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "), so that the chapters, which were written as separate programs, cannot \
change each other's symbols."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e8dc3b78-6271-4891-affc-9cfbf9a9f33a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["What the notebook does not repeat.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The long numerical computations of the manuscript (the evolutions in time \
of Parts V and VI, which take minutes to forty minutes) are done by the Rust \
programs with the integrator CVODE of SUNDIALS; they are not repeated here. \
The notebook repeats only those numbers that a Wolfram script recomputes \
independently: three quasi-bound states and three greybody factors of Part IV \
(checks WS-7 and WS-8), found again in arithmetic of 32 digits."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6bec8bc9-8fc3-4fa9-93a4-beda3d69f153"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. The register of the checks", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"7740bbd4-aa60-4b72-b0d7-a91663d98745"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines the functions that record and print a check. ",
 StyleBox["check[id, text, ok, detail]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a check that is decided by facts, such as an exact identity: it \
passes when ",
 StyleBox["ok",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is ",
 StyleBox["True",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", and ",
 StyleBox["detail",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " states the facts. ",
 StyleBox["checkDev[id, text, dev, tol]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a numerical check: it passes when the measured deviation ",
 StyleBox["dev",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is at most the tolerance ",
 StyleBox["tol",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Both append an association to the list ",
 StyleBox["LGNB`Test`$Results",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", the register of all checks, and print the same line that the scripts \
print into their reports (the files ",
 StyleBox["data/hck_lg_*_checks_wolfram.txt",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the folder). The function ",
 StyleBox["fmt",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " writes a number with four significant digits in the form ",
 StyleBox["2.857e-8",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9bdfa779-21ab-4f9c-81c4-453d88267a40"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "register", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "checks", " ", "of", " ",
      "this", " ", 
     RowBox[{"notebook", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"one", " ", "association", " ", "per", " ", "check"}]}]}], ",", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"in", " ", "the", " ", "order", " ", "of", " ", "evaluation"}]}], 
   " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"LGNB`Test`$Results", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"fmt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "nd"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"a", " ", "real", " ", "number", " ", "written", " ", 
        RowBox[{"d", ".", "ddde"}]}], "-", 
       RowBox[{
       "x", " ", "with", " ", "nd", " ", "significant", " ", "digits"}]}]}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "as", " ", "the", " ", "reports", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "scripts", 
      " ", "write", " ", "it", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "the", "\n", "   ", "function", " ", "fmt", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ",
          "script", " ", 
         RowBox[{"lg_schw", ".", "wls"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "with", " ", "other", " ", "names", " ", "for", " ", "its", " ", 
         "variables"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "so", " ", "that", " ", "no", " ", "common", " ", "name", " ", "such",
          " ", "as", " ", "x", " ", "is", "\n", "   ", "created", " ", "in", " ",
          "the", " ", "context", " ", "Global`"}]}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"fmt", "[", 
      RowBox[{"lgX_", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"lgNd_", " ", ":", " ", "4"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"lgE", ",", " ", "lgMm", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"lgY", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "lgX", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lgY", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "\"\<0\>\"", ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"lgE", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "lgY", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
          RowBox[{"lgMm", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "lgY", "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"lgNd", " ", "-", " ", "1", " ", "-", " ", "lgE"}], 
               ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"lgMm", " ", ">=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", "lgNd"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"lgMm", " ", "=", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
               RowBox[{"lgMm", "/", "10"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
             RowBox[{"lgE", " ", "=", " ", 
              RowBox[{"lgE", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
          "   ", 
          RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lgY", " ", "<", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "\"\<-\>\"", ",",
               " ", "\"\<\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Quotient", "[", 
              RowBox[{"lgMm", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"10", "^", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{"lgNd", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], 
             "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<.\>\"", ",", "\n", "    ", 
            RowBox[{"IntegerString", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
               RowBox[{"lgMm", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"10", "^", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{"lgNd", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], ",",
               " ", "10", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"lgNd", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
            " ", "\"\<e\>\"", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "lgE", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"called", " ", "after", " ", "every", " ", "check"}]}], ";", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"it", " ", "does", " ", "nothing", " ", "here", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "dry", " ", "run", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "code", " ",
         "without", " ", "the", " ", "front", " ", "end", " ", "uses", " ", 
        "it", "\n", "   ", "to", " ", "print", " ", "the", " ", "computing", " ",
         "time", " ", "of", " ", "each", " ", "check"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "Null"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "ok", ",", " ", "detail"}], 
       "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "check", " ", "decided", " ", "by", " ", "facts"}]}], 
     ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "it", " ", "passes", " ", "when", " ", "ok", " ", "is", " ", "True"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "lgId_String", ",", " ", "lgText_String", ",", " ", "lgOk_", ",", " ", 
       "lgDetail_String"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lgPass", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "lgOk", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "lgLine"}], "}"}], 
       ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lgLine", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
            "lgPass", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
            "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"StringPadRight", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lgId", ",", " ", "9"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "lgText", ",", 
           " ", "\"\< [\>\"", ",", " ", "lgDetail", ",", " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], 
          "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"LGNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgId"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgPass"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            "\n", "     ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<line\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgLine"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", "lgLine", "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "lgPass"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkDev", "[", 
       RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "dev", ",", " ", "tol"}], 
       "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "numerical", " ", "check"}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "it", " ", "passes", " ", "when", " ", "the", " ", "deviation", " ", 
      "dev", " ", "is", " ", "at", " ", "most", " ", "the", " ", "tolerance", 
      " ", "tol"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkDev", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "lgId_String", ",", " ", "lgText_String", ",", " ", "lgDev_", ",", " ", 
       "lgTol_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lgPass", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"lgDev", " ", "<=", " ", "lgTol"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         "lgLine"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lgLine", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
            "lgPass", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
            "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"StringPadRight", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lgId", ",", " ", "9"}], "]"}], ",", 
           " ", "\"\<deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"fmt", "[", "lgDev", "]"}], ",", 
           " ", "\"\< (tolerance \>\"", ",", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"fmt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lgTol", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<): \>\"", 
           ",", " ", "lgText"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"LGNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgId"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgPass"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "lgDev", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "lgTol", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<line\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "lgLine"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", "lgLine", "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "lgPass"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"157458e0-feff-45b3-86ac-58621a27e535"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
1. Lord's paper and the association (Parts I and II of the manuscript)\
\>", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"bcbd663f-e3d7-4a4c-a4ae-f418713e9908"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Lord writes a four-vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "294de478-c360-41ae-a238-18aba79c2e20"],
 " as the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a0cae0e5-00e9-4c6e-ba78-db06fc0f326d"],
 " Hermitian matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e167a48-3f91-4e91-993b-250bdb940630"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56ee0d13-b176-478f-9a47-5ce10a3fca96"],
 " is the unit matrix and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "1", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e5d9e83c-2bc4-4714-ac25-97fc29288986"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f7d89181-1f95-4154-ad35-8e1bc3fab4ed"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8c7a25e3-1bbd-4183-b1f8-624495123cc2"],
 " are the Pauli matrices. Its determinant is the Minkowski square ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b35ae642-112b-4a60-8107-4a00234016e1"],
 ". His central observation is that the four matrices need not be the Pauli \
matrices: any four Hermitian matrices whose products obey the same rules will \
do, and changing from one such set to another is a change of representation. \
Requiring that the physics does not depend on this choice, at every point \
separately, is a gauge principle, and its gauge field turns out to be \
gravitation. This chapter checks, in exact arithmetic, the identities of his \
Section 1 (the algebra of the matrices) and the signs and factors of his \
Section 4 (the gauge transformation), where several printed formulas do not \
follow from his definitions; three of them are checked here."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5c52e801-1afb-4016-9b60-b43ec4b05c3b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 StyleBox["bar",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " of a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06940e27-0fc0-43e9-a734-c95da02fa913"],
 " matrix is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["E",
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["T", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a454398a-e41e-433c-bbd1-54bfc6f82a3d"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
       {"0", "1"},
       {
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "0"}
      },
      GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
      GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
          Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
           Offset[0.7]}, 
          Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
          Offset[0.2], {
           Offset[0.4]}, 
          Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d94500a8-34ef-4fdc-924b-b1ff49e0c3dd"],
 " (Lord's ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Epsilon]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ba63f3c6-d0c7-4147-95e7-fca45931a30b"],
 "); for an invertible matrix it is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["det",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "33414156-529b-42e1-88a0-5d4d1fbb5c31"],
 " times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25d1872d-8a11-45a2-8c38-146199777695"],
 ". The products ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       OverscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "_"], "\[Nu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Nu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       OverscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "_"], "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8fd42aab-fc70-4d3b-bfd2-56e7bbdabdc6"],
 " generate the Lorentz transformations on two-component spinors, and the \
Dirac matrices are the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6c856f59-26ac-46a0-94af-00d5bff1325e"],
 " matrices ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
       {"0", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]]},
       {
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         OverscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "_"], "\[Mu]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "0"}
      },
      GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
      GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
          Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
           Offset[0.7]}, 
          Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
          Offset[0.2], {
           Offset[0.4]}, 
          Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bb5b279-fbe8-4663-acc7-31ec4d680179"],
 " (the Weyl form). In the code: ",
 StyleBox["sig",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for the four ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "621a5f82-1acb-4087-9d72-617d9a06813b"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["eps",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6fd27e79-b2a7-412a-8a42-7ea0ca1f7c6d"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["bar",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for the bar, ",
 StyleBox["smn",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "293cb0e6-4cc1-474f-bfcb-da1357693342"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["gam",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["gm",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for the Dirac matrices, ",
 StyleBox["g5",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for Lord's ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "5"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "adf03a7e-5316-4f6d-ae81-5977df2e21f7"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["cc",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " for his charge-conjugation matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["C", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a2423a4b-3c0c-4433-8801-3d874e70290a"],
 ". The indices 1 to 4 of the code are the indices 0 to 3 of the texts."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5ad0411b-dcd1-420f-bf41-fdbf13c74810"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "the", " ", "symbols", " ", "that", " ", "the", " ", "code", " ", "of", " ",
     "this", " ", "chapter", " ", "creates", " ", "live", " ", "in", " ", 
    "the", " ", "context", " ", "LGNB`Lord`", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "code", " ", "is", " ", "that", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
      "script", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"wolfram", "/", "source"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"lg_lord", ".", "wls"}]}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Begin", "[", "\"\<LGNB`Lord`\>\"", "]"}], ";"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:=",ExpressionUUID->"da570353-cfc9-49d5-8782-1c1edc0db56b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The helper function ",
 StyleBox["zeroQ[m]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " decides whether every entry of a matrix (or a list of matrices) simplifies \
to zero."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ccf1f471-0948-4c1b-b3eb-1bea4641124a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "the", " ", "helper", " ", "functions", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
    "script", " ", 
    RowBox[{"lg_lord", ".", "wls"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "m", "]"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"#", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}]}], "]"}]}], 
   ";"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:=",ExpressionUUID->"be57934f-8546-4dc4-8547-1f4c8f73bb5b"],

Cell["Lord's matrices, exactly as he defines them.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1414ada0-754c-4248-b578-1843d292d2d6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"--", 
      RowBox[{"--", 
       RowBox[{"--", 
        RowBox[{"--", 
         RowBox[{"--", 
          RowBox[{"--", 
           RowBox[{"--", 
            RowBox[{"--", 
             RowBox[{"--", 
              RowBox[{"--", 
               RowBox[{"--", 
                RowBox[{"--", 
                 RowBox[{"--", 
                  RowBox[{"--", 
                   RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{"--", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "--", " ", 
                    "Lord"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]\
}]}]}]}]}]}]}], "'"}], "s", " ", "matrices", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"indices", " ", "1"}], ".."}], "4"}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"0", ".."}], "3"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sig", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"I", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"eps", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"eta", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"bar", "[", "s_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      RowBox[{"eps", " ", ".", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "eps"}]}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"smn", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s_", ",", " ", "m_", ",", " ", "n_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"s", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"bar", "[", 
          RowBox[{"s", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"s", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"bar", "[", 
          RowBox[{"s", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"gam", "[", "s_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ArrayFlatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "s"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"bar", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"g5", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"cc", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ArrayFlatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"eps", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", "eps"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"gmn", "[", 
      RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "m_", ",", " ", "n_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"g", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"g", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "n", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"g", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"g", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"levi", "[", 
      RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_", ",", " ", "c_", ",", " ", "d_"}], "]"}], 
     " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Signature", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "b", ",", " ", "c", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "   ", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"eps_", "0123"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"+", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"gm", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"gam", " ", "/@", " ", "sig"}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b85f10a8-b023-4293-bf2a-bef0fbbb49c0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["WL-1: the identities of Lord's Section 1", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"64655bd4-b884-4d40-8624-b0dd5e6f39b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Lord's Section 1 lists the rules that his matrices obey: the bar of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d7a0e991-b8f5-4cf8-8cf1-f4f756972341"],
 " (1.2); the relation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       OverscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "_"], "\[Nu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Nu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       OverscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "_"], "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8e79215b-0426-4446-a074-edd5719ef3cf"],
 " (1.3), which says that the matrices carry the Minkowski metric; the \
commutators of the generators ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c1f2a241-4eba-4b07-aa30-3df16419ae44"],
 " (1.5), which are those of the Lorentz algebra; their self-duality (1.7); \
the Clifford relation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Mu]"], ",", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Nu]"]}], "}"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "19f1f06d-7b5f-460c-bb5f-7ffb3f458212"],
 " (1.10); the properties of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "5"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "317f11a2-4e05-4e46-87ff-dd3db9be05b8"],
 " and of the charge-conjugation matrix (1.11) to (1.14); and the block form \
of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e3d54e6-3423-4c3a-9529-8b80ad5573d3"],
 " (1.15) and its duality (1.17). The cell evaluates every one of them for \
all index combinations (for (1.5) these are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["4", "4"], "\[LongEqual]", "256"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "103ccffd-c92e-4d18-b3b7-7edc99ff8c50"],
 " combinations), in exact arithmetic. These are the rules that every later \
computation uses, so a single wrong sign here would spoil everything after it."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d4059f8-878a-4398-bee2-a4a5c13b07d0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"--", 
     RowBox[{"--", 
      RowBox[{"--", 
       RowBox[{"--", 
        RowBox[{"--", 
         RowBox[{"--", 
          RowBox[{"--", 
           RowBox[{"--", 
            RowBox[{"--", 
             RowBox[{"--", 
              RowBox[{"--", 
               RowBox[{"--", 
