= 1/4 W_{ab} gamma^{ab} (W antisymmetric, \\\nsymbolic) satisfies [lambda(W), \
gamma_b] = -W_b^e gamma_e and [lambda(W1), lambda(W2)] = lambda([W1, W2]): a \
