= r dth, e^3 = r sin(th) dph (the frame of the observers falling freely from \
rest at infinity): the metric is Schwarzschild's under T = t + int v/f dr; \
Ricci zero; Omega_T = M/(2 r^2) gamma^0 gamma^1, Omega_r = v/(4 r) gamma^0 \
gamma^1, Omega_th = 1/2 (-v gamma^0 gamma^2 + gamma^1 gamma^2), Omega_ph = \
