Cell[BoxData["\<\"PASS WG-5     (Rust G-13; Python YG-6) the energy-momentum \
tensor of the brochon from the variation of the action e [i/2 (psi-bar \
gamma^mu nabla_mu psi - (nabla_mu psi)-bar gamma^mu psi) - m psi-bar psi] \
with respect to the tetrad, at first order about flat space-time (e_a^mu = \
delta + eps h_{a mu}, sixteen symbolic functions h; symbolic psi and \
psi-bar): the symmetric part of Theta_{mu nu} = (dS/de_a^mu) eta_{a nu} is \
exactly T_{mu nu} = i/4 (psi-bar gamma_mu d_nu psi + psi-bar gamma_nu d_mu \
psi - d_mu psi-bar gamma_nu psi - d_nu psi-bar gamma_mu psi) - eta_{mu nu} L, \
off shell; the antisymmetric part is not zero off shell and vanishes on a \
solution (two plane waves of mass 3) [symmetric part = T True, solution True, \
antisymmetric part 0 on shell True, and not off shell True]\"\>"], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0043982474770412`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[152]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9deea8a1-3507-473e-9715-c37676818a31"]
