  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fea16daa-96b3-4184-b687-cfdc388e8541"],
 " of (18.3), which bring the separated spinor into its simplest form."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c9c77585-fbb5-4840-a6f5-6f31353df42f"],

