 "The data of the Rust program that the next two checks compare with: the \
files ",
 StyleBox["data/lg_schw_qbs.csv",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " (the quasi-bound states) and ",
 StyleBox["data/lg_schw_grey.csv",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " (the greybody factors), in closed cells."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ab74e0b6-845b-45a3-9061-690953173488"],

