Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["WS-7: three quasi-bound states", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6f60ee5d-4d3f-40ac-af47-ae4b3b159da2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A quasi-bound state is a solution that is smooth at the horizon and decays \
at infinity; like the levels of a hydrogen atom it exists only for discrete \
frequencies, here complex, because the state slowly falls into the black \
hole. For the coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalM]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["3", "10"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "288f920a-36de-48f4-ba94-6904a5658013"],
 " (in the code ",
 StyleBox["mmQ",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ") the check takes the states ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79885da9-dfdc-4fcb-8fe7-8d8d5950a580"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b24d4dcb-168e-40a5-b289-2b1e5fc75b25"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5c07980f-259a-443c-a1d9-bb779c5f695f"],
 ": it integrates outward from the horizon and inward from a large radius \
(where it starts from the decaying solution), measures the mismatch of the \
two at a middle radius, and lets ",
 StyleBox["FindRoot",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " move the frequency until the mismatch vanishes, starting ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "4"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "eca35335-0831-4550-b14b-46e000080fa3"],
 " away from the Rust value. The largest difference from the Rust values, \
divided by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2fd8a8ed-43fa-497a-b877-0937a93744eb"],
 ", must be below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "11"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d228713-2d4b-4f5f-86af-d04456175eea"],
 " (the Rust values have the accuracy of double precision)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a92561e4-71a6-4d1b-92d6-c2544a17934c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"--", 
      RowBox[{"--", 
       RowBox[{"--", 
        RowBox[{"--", 
         RowBox[{"--", 
          RowBox[{"--", 
