Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["WV-3 to WV-4b: the link to Part IV", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"357d01ea-2532-4d4d-8000-0318ca544eda"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For a constant mass the equations must reduce to those of Part IV. With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalP]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["S",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      StyleBox["v", "TI"]}]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "95ea694c-82f1-4d6d-b4a2-68c8fbde9fc9"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalQ]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["S",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      StyleBox["v", "TI"]}]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a45e302e-25a1-466a-8e2f-be83a70bf4cc"],
 " they become static equations whose exponents at the horizon are again ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70f635ef-91ec-4916-8a75-f2470ab05b34"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51bf95f6-90ff-4da5-9aae-f8a234da1f38"],
 " (WV-3). Their solutions are the freely falling solutions of Part IV: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LG",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["S",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      StyleBox["h", "TI"]}]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalP]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "358a2e9b-b9af-441f-8648-f73a0cfb8f1f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LG",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["S",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      StyleBox["h", "TI"]}]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalQ]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d649c398-deb3-4dd5-bbe1-a2d3ec2018d0"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], "\[LongEqual]", "1", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f5c1775-d966-4846-8904-652ce334dee7"],
 " (so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["h", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d46057f0-c85f-40c3-b6ee-8a4920a9369f"],
 " is the function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a2ef6eb0-8621-4482-a9f3-00a064461aeb"],
 " of (24.7)); the opposite exponents fail, a control (WV-4). The reason \
(WV-4b): the coframe of Part V is the freely falling coframe boosted in the \
radial direction with the rapidity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[CurlyTheta]", 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     StyleBox["ln",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "38cf9b06-1546-46ef-8b33-2f2b6116f9b4"],
 ", and a boost multiplies the two radial functions by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", "\[CurlyTheta]"}], "/", "2"}]], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cf545c3-0f92-465c-871c-53746097e173"],
 ". WV-5 shows that the radial light rays are the lines of constant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70fe4ebf-c910-4b95-90b0-764c33fe07f9"],
 " (falling in) and the lines along which (24.2) differentiates ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalP]",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["V",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "089fcd1e-62f6-4e18-89d6-f0465c6a4217"],
 " (going out); the Rust program uses this to cut the inside of the black \
hole off its grid."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cb3f0abf-1ebb-4a47-8e26-89e4a67beddc"],

