   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<WV-3\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<(Rust LV-2; Python YV-3) for a constant mass (M = 1) the \
substitution P = e^(-i omega v) p(r), Q = e^(-i \\\nomega v) q(r) turns (V1), \
(V2) into r (r - 2) p' = 2 i omega r^2 p - p - (i lambda r + m r^2) q, r q' = \
(i lambda - m r) p; \\\nthe residue matrix lim (r - 2) A(r) of this system at \
the horizon has the eigenvalues 0 (the solution analytic at r = 2, \\\nwhich \
falls in) and 4 i omega - 1/2, as in stage 5\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", "statV", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", "okEF"}], ",", 
      "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<the static reduction \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
