Cell[BoxData["\<\"PASS WV-3     (Rust LV-2; Python YV-3) for a constant mass \
(M = 1) the substitution P = e^(-i omega v) p(r), Q = e^(-i omega v) q(r) \
turns (V1), (V2) into r (r - 2) p' = 2 i omega r^2 p - p - (i lambda r + m \
r^2) q, r q' = (i lambda - m r) p; the residue matrix lim (r - 2) A(r) of \
this system at the horizon has the eigenvalues 0 (the solution analytic at r \
= 2, which falls in) and 4 i omega - 1/2, as in stage 5 [the static reduction \
{0, 0}; residue {{-1/2 + (4*I)*om, (-I)*lam - 2*mB}, {0, 0}}, eigenvalues {0, \
-1/2 + (4*I)*om}]\"\>"], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004398277531048*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[329]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b4ae4d34-7982-4296-ab79-cbb5fd0c71b1"]
}, Open  ]],

