Cell[BoxData["\<\"PASS WT-3     (Python YT-3) f = kappa (r^3/3 + r^2/2) \
solves the equation of Dalgarno and Lewis for psi_1 = f P_2 psi_0, and E = \
-1/2 - (15/2) kappa^2 - (153/2) kappa^3 + O(kappa^4) (E_2 = <psi_0|V|psi_1>, \
E_3 = <psi_1|V|psi_1>) [solves: True; E_2/kappa^2 = -15/2; E_3/kappa^3 = \
-153/2]\"\>"], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004398282562669*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[430]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e74b6a70-9d93-42c9-bd6c-9c9150d8404a"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["WT-4: the rate of tunnelling in a weak field", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7c806b60-5cb4-41c8-bc3e-8e853ad155fe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In a static tidal field the pair can tunnel through its barrier and fly \
apart, at the rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tid",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "168c58e3-a8dc-4944-89ef-9bc80962ac59"],
 ". For a weak field the rate follows from the solution near the nucleus and \
the semiclassical solution under the barrier. The check first applies the \
method to a uniform field of the strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["u",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "686bad70-8f1a-4a0c-9752-5695b9b00bbe"],
 ", where it must give Landau's rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"4", "/", 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["u",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"3", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LG",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], 
         StyleBox["u",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d668ae2-cca2-48de-8df5-5e745fa0dba8"],
 " (it does), and then to the tidal field, where it gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"8", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Kappa]", 
       StyleBox["LG",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["tid",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "\[Pi]"}], "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[Kappa]", 
            StyleBox["LG",
             FontSlant->"Plain"], 
            StyleBox["tid",
             FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], "/", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["sinh",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", 
      SqrtBox["2"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e3a1e986-d6db-4333-ab0a-7c5bb02466fa"],
 ", the formula that the manuscript compares with the computed rates."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9a5b5b68-2e53-4f17-89d3-6fc7708c315f"],

