   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<WW-1\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<(LW-1 to LW-3) the change of representation by S = \
M_LL(gtilde) of the boost (5/4) e_0 + (3/4) i e_3: \\\nS = diag(1/2, 2), the \
matrices sigma'_mu, their bars and polarized determinants, Lord's Dirac \
matrices = S4 gamma^a S4^-1 \\\nwith S4 = S_LL(g), the Clifford relation, the \
Lorentz matrix L of the boost, gamma'^a = (L^-1)_ab gamma^b, (9.3), and the \
