Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
WW-3: a plane wave of the brochon and its energy and momentum\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"49679ab5-d17c-444e-b9b5-8e6c7a7d47ef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The plane wave with the spinor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], ",", "0", ",", "2", ",", "0"}], ")"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cc5b70b1-e02f-48a9-a0ee-9c52056ec276"],
 ", the momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LG",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["17", "8"], ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", 
      FractionBox["15", "8"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3efa542e-ea5e-4377-905e-e6d5a06afe66"],
 " and the mass 1 (the boosted rest spinor of Appendix A) is checked with \
symbolic coordinates: it solves the free Dirac equation, its current is twice \
its momentum, its Lagrangian density vanishes (as it must on a solution), and \
its energy-momentum tensor (16.2) is twice the product of the momentum with \
itself, with the trace 2: the tensor of a stream of particles of the momentum \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LG",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d1b2b894-ba9f-4b82-9469-98ee236b287e"],
 "."
