\nI^(1)(E_gap)/Pi^2 = 1 and Pi^2/I^(1)(1/5) = G^crit_LL hold to the ten \
printed digits\>\"", ",", " ", "ok5", ",", "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Integrate: \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"InputForm", "[", "i1int", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
       " ", "\"\<; symbolic equality: \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "okSym", "]"}], " ", "<>", 
       " ", "\"\<, numerical equality: \>\"", " ", "<>", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "okNum", "]"}], " ", "<>", 
       " ", "\"\<, 23.7 I1(E_gap)/Pi^2 = \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"lhs", ",", " ", "15"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", "\n", 
       "   ", "\"\<, Pi^2/I1(1/5) = \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"gcr", ",", " ", "15"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[578]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c6769fc2-6b10-4f9d-a7af-a3065ade9fb6"],

Cell[BoxData["\<\"PASS WW-5     (LW-7) the integral I^(1)(M) of (A.19), \
computed by Integrate for M > 0, equals its closed form symbolically and as \
numbers of 40 digits at M = 3/10 and 1/5; with the printed numbers the gap \
equation 23.7 I^(1)(E_gap)/Pi^2 = 1 and Pi^2/I^(1)(1/5) = G^crit_LL hold to \
the ten printed digits [Integrate: (Sqrt[1 + mx^2] - mx^2*ArcCoth[Sqrt[1 + \
mx^2]])/2; symbolic equality: True, numerical equality: True, 23.7 \
I1(E_gap)/Pi^2 = 0.999999999995666, Pi^2/I1(1/5) = 21.2866097555497]\"\>"], \
"Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004398284628717*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[578]:=",ExpressionUUID->"698aab37-0ead-44c3-8db4-ebaa70b0b78b"]
}, Open  ]],

